  "notes": "FORMS:\n{勘|かん} (intuition) + {違|ちが}い (difference, mistake) → intuition gone wrong\n{勘違|かんちが}いする (to misunderstand, to be mistaken)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {誤解|ごかい} (misunderstanding - more serious, often between people)\n- {思|おも}い{違|ちが}い (misconception - based on wrong belief)\n- {聞|き}き{間違|まちが}い (mishearing)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {勘違|かんちが}いしないでね (Don't get the wrong idea)\n- {勘違|かんちが}いも{甚|はなは}だしい (It's a gross misunderstanding)",
